<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">E. N. Coleman, L. Quarantiello, Z. Liu, Q. Yang, S. Mukherjee, J. Hurtado, and V. Lomonaco</span><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_year"> (2025)</span>
