<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The hyperparameters used in our experiments are detailed in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.1 Detailed Experiments Settings ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Learning in the Null Space: Small Singular Values for Continual Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>. For more details on the learning rate (lr) and <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varepsilon_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varepsilon_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> in each experiment, please see the Appendix <a href="#A1.SS2" title="A.2 Additional Results ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Learning in the Null Space: Small Singular Values for Continual Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>List of (general) hyperparameters used in our experiments.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T4.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T4.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dataset</span></td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T4.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CIFAR-100</span></td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T4.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5-Datasets</span></td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T4.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MiniImageNet</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T4.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T4.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Batch size (<math id="A1.T4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math>)</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">64</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">64</td>
<td id="A1.T4.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">64</td></tr>
